<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on Aug 15.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on Aug 15.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				   Aug 15		Aug 14</p>
<p>Fed acct			  3.876		 5.158</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	    6.214		17.638</p>
<p>Cash balance		   10.090		22.796</p>
<p>	  ---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	 5,308.507	   5,293.858</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $370 million were issued and $36 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
